OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do 'now in a minute',
OL,4,A'twpsyn' and 'bwbach' have in common?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat do now in a minute, twpsyn, and
OL,7,Fbwbach have in common?
OL,9,FThey are among six words and phrases
OL,10,Ffrom Wales added to the latest update
OL,11,Fof the Oxford English Dictionary (OED).
OL,13,FThe list includes a word for an idiot,
OL,14,Fa phrase that does not necessarily mean
OL,15,Fa minute and a mischievous creature
OL,16,Ffrom Welsh folklore.
OL,18,FThe OED is a historical dictionary
OL,19,Fcontaining more than 500,000 words,
OL,20,Fphrases and meanings from more than
OL,21,F1,000 years of the English language.
